# Smart Healthcare Monitoring Platform

on first use: pip install -r requirements.txt
all the commands shouls run after: source venv/bin/activate

## Edge Module – Local Data Cache & Offline Buffer

This repository contains the full Edge-side implementation of the
Local Data Cache & Offline Buffer module, developed according to the approved Low-Level Design (LLD) and implemented using Test-Driven Development (TDD).

The module guarantees:

- Zero data loss
- Offline operation
- Crash-safe recovery
- Encrypted storage at rest
- Reliable FIFO synchronization of medical events between Edge and Cloud

This project represents a complete logical backend system, including storage, buffering, synchronization, fault tolerance, encryption, and a runnable demo.

